DELETE /v1/registrycredentials/{registryCredentialId}
Delete the registry credential with the provided ID.
Required: registryCredentialId (path) — The ID of the registry credential

GET /v1/registrycredentials/{registryCredentialId}
Retrieve the registry credential with the provided ID.
Required: registryCredentialId (path) — The ID of the registry credential

PATCH /v1/registrycredentials/{registryCredentialId}
Update the registry credential with the provided ID. Services that use this credential must be redeployed to use updated values.
Required: registryCredentialId (path) — The ID of the registry credential; body (body)
